rīla Narottam Dās Ṭhākur","first_line":"rādhā-kṛṣṇa prāṇa mora jugala-kiśora"},"title":["Sakhi-vṛnde Vijñaptiḥ"],"author":["by Śrīla Narottam Dās Ṭhākur"],"subtitle":["Prayer to the Gopīs"],"verses":[{"number":"1","text":["rādhā-kṛṣṇa prāṇa mora jugala-kiśora","jīvane maraṇe gati āra nāhi mora"],"translation":["The youthful Divine Couple Śrī Śrī Rādhā and Kṛṣṇa are my life and soul. In life or death I have no other refuge but Them."],"isLong":false},{"number":"2","text":["kālindīra kūle keli-kadambera vana","ratana-bedira upara basāba dujana"],"translation":["I shall install the Divine Couple on a jewelled throne in a pleasant forest of kadamba trees on the shore of the Yamunā river."],"isLong":false},{"number":"3","text":["śyāma-gaurī-aṅge dia chandanera gandha","chāmara ḍhulāba kabe heriba mukha-chandra"],"translation":["When will I place aromatic sandalwood paste on the limbs of Lord Śyāmasundar and Śrīmatī Rādhārāṇī? When will I fan Them with a chāmara wisk? When will I see Their moonlike faces?"],"isLong":false},{"number":"4","text":["gāṅthiyā mālātira mālā diba doṅhāra gale","adhare tuliyā diba karpūra-tāmbule"],"translation":["When will I string garlands of malati flowers and place them on the necks of the Divine Couple? When will I place betel nuts mixed with camphor in Their lotus mouths?"],"isLong":false},{"number":"5","text":["lalitā visākhā-ādi jata sakhī-vṛnda","ājñāya kariba sevā charaṇāravinda"],"translation":["When, following the orders of Lalitā, Viśākhā, and the other gopīs, will I serve the lotus feet of the Divine Couple?"],"isLong":false},{"number":"6","text":["śrī-kṛṣṇa-chaitanya-prabhura dāsera anudāsa","sevā abhilāṣa kare narottama-dāsa"],"translation":["Narottam Dās, the servant of the servant of Śrī Kṛṣṇa Chaitanya Mahāprabhu, longs for this service to the Divine Couple."],"isLong":false}],"resources":{"audio":[{"title":"Srila B.S. Govinda Dev-Goswami Maharaj","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/krsnachaitanya-das/34-radha-krsna-prana-mora-yugala-kisora-6","personSlug":"srila-b-s-govinda-dev-goswami-maharaj"},{"title":"Manasa Krishna Prabhu","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/huron/radha-krishna-prana-mora","personSlug":"manasa-krishna-prabhu"}]},"hasWbw":false,"hasVersesText":true,"hasVersesTranslations":true,"hasLongVerses":false,"fullInlineWbw":false},"telegraphUrl":"https://telegra.ph/Sakhi-vṛnde-Vijñaptiḥ-02-22"},"head":{"canonical":"/en/radha-krishna-prana-mora-jugala-kishora/","description":"Sakhi-vṛnde Vijñaptiḥ — a Vaiṣṇava song by Śrīla Narottam Dās Ṭhākur with lyrics, English translation and word-by-word meaning. From Kirtan Guide.","title":"Sakhi-vṛnde Vijñaptiḥ. Prayer to the Gopīs | Kirtan Site"},"kind":"song","route":{"kind":"item","bookId":"en","slug":"radha-krishna-prana-mora-jugala-kishora"}}